# ❗ Image Permission

Add the protocol, hostname, port, and pathname to the `images.remotePatterns` config in `next.config.js`

```
images: {
    remotePatterns: [
      {
        protocol: 'https',
        hostname: '*',
        port: '',
        pathname: '/**',
      },
    ],
  },
```

