# 🔰API Routes

🔴Variáveis dinâmicas acessáveis pelo req.

```javascript
//.../pages/api/comments/[id].js
import comments from '../comments.json'

export default (req, res) => {
  res.status(200).json({
    post: req.query.id,
    comments
  })
